react to your every move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over a dozen playable classes, each with their own weapons and abilities  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge arsenal\u2014greatswords, spears, guns, claws, and magic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hundreds of handcrafted rooms across procedurally generated maps  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret platforming zones with rare loot and hidden horrors  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Randomly generated quests with powerful rewards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple color palettes to match your vibe and mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Infinite runs and future updates to keep the chaos going </p></li></ul>","developers":["Nikola Todorovic"],"dlc":[2493860],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1494810/6afac10ddffc177a404b3128cd883a2b08c60698/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1746227078","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133075,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133075/movie480.mp4?t=1745972062","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133075/movie_max.mp4?t=1745972062"},"name":"Realistic Visuals Update","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133075/bd24bf600b2e8acc58365ddaceea78099f3561bc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745972062","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133075/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745972062","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133075/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745972062"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257125420,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125420/movie480.mp4?t=1744507710","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s